        "divine",
        "necromancy"
      ],
      "entries": [
        "When Zellara is destroyed, she re-forms after 2d4 days at the site of her destruction, fully healed. If she is bound to a harrow deck or harrow card, Zellara can manifest near the bound item instead. Once her ex-student Raven has been defeated, Zellara will return to the Boneyard|GMG to face her final judgment."
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Unbound Fate",
      "category": "passive",
      "placement": "mid",
      "activity": null,
      "traits": [],
      "entries": [
        "Zellara's connection to the harrow and fortune-telling in life have given her full control of her fate in the afterlife. She can ignore any fortune or misfortune effects that affect her. If she is forced to roll twice as part of a fortune and misfortune effect, she can take whichever die result she prefers, even if the effect would normally force her to choose one of the results."
      ]
